      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "房间卡强化车厢，装备卡直接附加到单位",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Room Cards add impressive boosts to your train, allowing you new strategic advantages over your foes. Equipment Cards can be applied to units, giving them a variety of bonuses to aid you in battle!",
