      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "不同薪火之心既改写开局功能，也推动主线故事",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Each Pyre Heart brings unique functionality to gameplay. Unlocking them not only provides another way to customize your run before departing, but also plays a key role in advancing the story.",
